From aab30a6cbba5341d0147d49acf6d7fbc4fa7d4da Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dirk-Jan Faber <dfaber@victronenergy.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 10:01:08 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] update the translations

Pulled from POEditor, for the EVCS alarms of commit a1111a7 ("evcs: add
v2 alarms and prefix all alarms with their code"). That commit changed
the English text of 12 alarms; they were renamed in POEditor before this
pull, so their translations are kept, with the code added in front. The
10 new alarms are translated in all 21 languages.

Also brings in the fixes made in POEditor since the last update: the
feature name "Opportunity Loads" is no longer translated, in every
language, and 23 Czech strings were corrected after a review.

Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5-5
